-- AWS for Database Administrators — downloadable lab code
-- Lab 5 — Oracle GoldenGate to AWS
-- Step 5 — Configure and start Replicat
-- Block: Write the Replicat parameters, then add and start Replicat
-- EDIT PARAMS RSHOP:
-- Enter with: EDIT PARAMS RSHOP
--
-- GoldenGate parameter file. In the Admin Client run EDIT PARAMS (name),
-- replace the editor contents with the lines below, save and exit.
-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------

REPLICAT RSHOP
USERIDALIAS tgt_pdb DOMAIN OracleGoldenGate
MAP shop.*, TARGET shop.*;
